      "reasoning": "Keil (after Vitringa and Hengstenberg) holds that the seventy years were completed twice — under Cyrus and, nearly, from the Temple's destruction to Darius's second year (587/586 to 520/519 is 66–68 years). Mitchell suggests counting from 605 or a loose count. The question concerns the meaning of the text; it is recorded here and on the existing prophecy record of Jeremiah's seventy years.",
